  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Know Til Know**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Dear One**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Exploding**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Actress**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **All Is Forgiven**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **God's Love To Deliver**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **His Master's Voice**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Dear God (Sincerely M.O.F)**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2013-04-23** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 120 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader advises watching the synced video at 720p, because 1080p turns interlaced and choppy [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lineup: Jim James (vocals, guitar, sax), Giva drums, Rocklin bass, Dorff keys, Ratterman keys/guitar/drum machine [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2013-04-23**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (ORTF/FOB) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Mytek Stereo 192 > Tascam HD-P2 (24/96) [1]. Also: Uploader's video was shot at the tour opener days earlier and synced to Porter's audio recording [2]",
